		(property "Description" "Goal indicator, physically next to G1 pin1 (wire 1). Lights to reproduce Complicated Wires attributes (color/star/lit) via color+blink pattern; not electrically tied to the terminal's own net. SK6812MINI-E, akizuki g115478, 3.2x2.8mm, pinout VDD/DOUT/GND/DIN same order as WS2812B. CAUTION: datasheet VIH=0.7*VDD=3.5V@VDD=5V, marginal for 3.3V-direct drive, unverified until bring-up."
